---
layout: default
---
{%- comment -%}
  홈 화면 틀. 이 파일에는 콘텐츠를 적지 않습니다.
  - 문구·버튼·통계 항목 : _pages/about.md (front matter)
  - 연구실 이름·소속     : _data/lab.yml,  교수님 이름 : _data/pi.yml
  - 슬라이드 이미지      : _data/highlights.yml
  - 연구 카드            : _projects/*.md (card: 항목)
  - Latest news          : _news/*.md
  - 고정 문구            : _data/strings.yml (home:)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign lab = site.data.lab -%}
{%- assign t = site.data.strings.home -%}
{%- assign hero = page.hero -%}
{%- assign research_page = site.pages | where: 'layout', 'research' | first -%}
<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">{% include lab-label.liquid %}</p>
<h1>{{ hero.title[0] | escape }}{% if hero.title[1] %}<br><span>{{ hero.title[1] | escape }}</span>{% endif %}</h1>
<p class="hero-subtitle">{{ hero.subtitle | escape }}</p>
<p class="hero-lede">{{ hero.lede | escape }}</p>
<div class="actions">{% for b in hero.buttons %}<a class="button {{ b.style | default: 'secondary' }}" href="{{ b.url | relative_url }}">{{ b.label | escape }}{% if b.style == 'primary' %} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>{% endif %}</a>{% endfor %}</div>
<p class="hero-affiliation">{{ t.directed_by | escape }} {{ site.data.pi.name | escape }}<br>{{ lab.department | escape }}, {{ lab.institution | escape }}</p></div>
{%- assign slides = site.data.highlights -%}
{%- assign slide_total = slides | size | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 %}
<div class="hero-visual"><div class="visual-label"><span>{{ t.research_highlights | escape }}</span><span>01 — {{ slide_total }}</span></div>
<div class="slideshow" id="slideshow"><div class="frame">{% for s in slides %}<img src="{{ s.image | prepend: '/assets/img/highlights/' | relative_url }}" alt="{% if s.alt %}{{ s.alt | escape }}{% else %}{{ t.image_alt | escape }} {{ forloop.index }}{% endif %}"{% if forloop.first %} class="active"{% else %} loading="lazy"{% endif %}>{% endfor %}</div><div class="slideshow-controls"><div class="nav-numbers" aria-label="{{ t.choose_image | escape }}" data-label="{{ t.show_image | escape }}"></div><button class="pause-slides" aria-label="{{ t.pause_slideshow | escape }}" data-label-pause="{{ t.pause | escape }}" data-label-play="{{ t.play | escape }}" data-aria-pause="{{ t.pause_slideshow | escape }}" data-aria-play="{{ t.play_slideshow | escape }}">{{ t.pause | escape }}</button></div></div>
<p class="visual-caption">{{ page.highlights_caption | escape }}</p></div>
</section>
{%- comment -%}
  숫자 통계. 항목은 _pages/about.md 의 stats: 에서 정하고, 숫자는 데이터에서 자동으로 계산합니다.
  source: publications → _bibliography/papers.bib 항목 수 / members → _data/members.yml 인원 수
          alumni → _data/alumni.yml / projects → _projects/ 연구 주제 수
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if page.stats %}
{%- capture pub_total -%}{% bibliography_count %}{%- endcapture %}
<section class="lab-stats" aria-label="{{ lab.name | escape }} {{ t.at_a_glance | escape }}">
  {%- for s in page.stats %}
  {%- case s.source -%}
    {%- when 'publications' -%}{%- assign value = pub_total | strip | plus: 0 -%}
    {%- when 'members' -%}{%- assign value = site.data.members | size -%}
    {%- when 'alumni' -%}{%- assign value = site.data.alumni | size -%}
    {%- when 'projects' -%}{%- assign value = site.projects | size -%}
    {%- else -%}{%- assign value = 0 -%}
  {%- endcase -%}
  {%- if s.link %}
  <a class="stat" href="{{ s.link | relative_url }}" aria-label="{{ value }} {{ s.label | escape }}">
  {%- else %}
  <div class="stat">
  {%- endif %}
    <span class="stat-value" data-count="{{ value }}">{{ value }}</span>
    <span class="stat-label">{{ s.label | escape }}</span>
  {%- if s.link %}
  </a>
  {%- else %}
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- endfor %}
</section>
{%- endif %}
{%- assign rs = page.research_section %}
<section class="research-teaser"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">{{ rs.eyebrow | escape }}</p><h2>{% for line in rs.title %}{{ line | escape }}{% unless forloop.last %}<br>{% endunless %}{% endfor %}</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="{{ research_page.url | relative_url }}">{{ rs.link_label | escape }}</a></div>
<div class="research-cards">
{%- assign projects = site.projects | sort: 'importance' -%}
{%- for p in projects %}
<a class="research-card{% if p.featured %} featured{% endif %}" href="{{ research_page.url | relative_url }}#{{ p.anchor }}"><span class="card-index">{{ forloop.index | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 }} / {{ p.card.label | upcase | escape }}</span><h3>{{ p.card.title | escape }}</h3><p>{{ p.card.summary | escape }}</p><span class="card-link">{{ t.explore_card | escape }}</span></a>
{%- endfor %}
</div></section>
{%- assign ns = page.news_section %}
<section class="lab-news">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">{{ ns.eyebrow | escape }}</p><h2>{{ ns.title | escape }}</h2></div></div>
    {%- assign news = site.news | sort: 'date' | reverse -%}
    {%- for item in news limit: ns.limit %}
    <article class="news-row"><span class="news-date">{{ item.date | date: ns.date_format }}</span>{{ item.content | strip }}</article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </section>
{%- assign jb = page.join %}
<section class="join-band"><div><p class="eyebrow">{{ jb.eyebrow | escape }}</p><h2>{% for line in jb.title %}{{ line | escape }}{% unless forloop.last %}<br>{% endunless %}{% endfor %}</h2></div><a class="button dark" href="{{ jb.button_url | relative_url }}">{{ jb.button_label | escape }}</a></section>
